s.aq(0,"SpriteBatch",new A.bnz(),"https://github.com/flame-engine/flame/blob/main/examples/lib/stories/sprites/sprite_batch_example.dart","    In this example we show how to render many sprites in a batch for\n    efficiency, this is done with `SpriteBatch` and the `SpriteBatchComponent`.\n  ")
